==Trivia==
*Broadband Omens' Japanese name, Enkyō Coupler (怨叫カプラ, "Grudgeful Scream Coupler"), is a pun on ''Onkyō Coupler'' (音響カプラ), meaning an [[wikipedia:Acoustic coupler|acoustic coupler]] used to convert digital signals into audio signals in order to transmit computer data across telephone lines.

